# Title: Suspicious Child Process of AspNetCompiler
# ID: 9ccba514-7cb6-4c5c-b377-700758f2f120
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2023-08-14
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.stealth, attack.t1127
# Description: Detects potentially suspicious child processes of "aspnet_compiler.exe".
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((((Image="*\\calc.exe" OR Image="*\\notepad.exe")) OR ((Image CONTAIN "\\Users\\Public\\" OR Image CONTAIN "\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\" OR Image CONTAIN "\\AppData\\Local\\Roaming\\" OR Image CONTAIN ":\\Temp\\" OR Image CONTAIN ":\\Windows\\Temp\\" OR Image CONTAIN ":\\Windows\\System32\\Tasks\\" OR Image CONTAIN ":\\Windows\\Tasks\\"))) AND (ParentImage="*\\aspnet_compiler.exe"))
